<p>jab izn paani laane ka abbas ko milaa<br />
bacchou ko jamma karke sakina ne ye kaha<br />
jaate hai ab furaat pa dekho mere chacha<br />
kuch der aur sabr karo tum pa mai fidaa</p>

<p>paani ki mai sabeel yaha'n par lagaaungi<br />
asghar ko sab se pehle mai paani pilaaungi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lehra raha hai dekho fazaaou'n me wo alam<br />
tezi se jaa raha hai soo-e- naher dam badam<br />
chaaya huwa alam pa hai abbas ka karam<br />
ab hogaya yaqeen ke paani piyenge ham</p>

<p>mashkeeza bhar ke naher se abbas aayenge<br />
pyaaso'n ko dono haatho'n se paani pilayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>pyaasa hai teen roz se maasoom beqataa<br />
paani ka ek qatraa bhi usko nahi mila<br />
karbobala ki dhoop hai aur garm hai hawa<br />
sookha huva hai pyaas se besheer ka gala</p>

<p>lab tar karungi unke to wo muskurayenge<br />
phailaaye dono haatho'n ko godi me aayenge<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye zikr is taraf tha udhar fouj-e- naabekaar<br />
baadal ki tarha chaane lagi phir se ekbaar<br />
ahle jafaa se bhar gaya maidaane kaarzaar<br />
chilla rahe the saar-e jafa jo sitam shiyaar</p>

<p>paani pahonch sake na imaam-e- hussain tak<br />
mashkeeza jaa sake na qayaam-e- hussain tak<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>naagaah ek waar kamee'n gaah se huwa<br />
shaana jari ka hoke juda jism se gira<br />
kuch door aur aage bade the ke aah aah<br />
tegh-e sitam se doosra shaana bhi kat gaya</p>

<p>daatho'n se mashk thaam ke abbas rehgaye<br />
darya lahu ke jism-e mubarak se beh-gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aise me ek teer laga aake mashk par<br />
mashke sakina chid gayi tharragaya jigar<br />
paani ke saath beh gaye ummeed ke gohar<br />
jhuk kar alam ne ghode ki baagho'n me di qabar</p>

<p>saqqa-e- ahlebait ke shaane qalam huwe<br />
bin bhaai ke jahaan me shah-e- umam huwe<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>akbar ki simt dekh ke bole shahe huda<br />
tooti kamar hussain ki aye mere dil ruba<br />
beta hamara quwwate baazu hua juda<br />
lo ho gaya hisaare hifaazat shigaafta</p>

<p>dil me hamaare naiza e ranjo malaal hai<br />
bhai ke gham me bhai ka jeena mohaal hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke hamlaawar huwe foujou'n pa shaahe dee'n<br />
hamshakl-e- mustafa ne ulatdi jo aastee'n<br />
tharraa gayi furaat larazne lagi zami'n<br />
jaane bachake bhaag gaye ran se sab laee'n</p>

<p>pahonche hussain tezi se bhaai ki laash par<br />
hasrat baras rahi thi tane paash paash par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bhaai ke sar ko shaah ne zaanu pa rakh liya<br />
the paayenti khade huwe hamshakl-e- mustafa<br />
phir roke apne bhaai se bole shahe huda<br />
dekho hussain aaya hai aye jaan-e- murtuza</p>

<p>ab aa chukaa hai waqt-e- judaai pukaar lo<br />
jaane se pehle bhaai ko bhaai pukaar lo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aankho'n ko apni khol ke bola wo tashnakaam<br />
sharminda hai sakina se abbas ya imaam<br />
laasha uthaane ka na kare aap ehtemaam<br />
ab hashr tak rahega hamara yahi'n muqaam</p>

<p>lillah baqsh deeje shafa'ath ke naam se<br />
koi kami hui ho agar is ghulaam se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>phir sheh ki simt dekh ke abbas ne kaha<br />
ye sab karam hai aapka ya shaahe karbala<br />
riqqat ka josh badh gaya ghutne laga galaa<br />
bhaai ke ek lafz me tha poora marsiya</p>

<p>bhaai kaha toh rooh badan se nikal gayi<br />
zaanu pa sheh ke gardan-e abbas dhal gayi</p>